{"id":"628894","name":"客家老鼠粄","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/628894/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老鼠粄","amount":"1人量"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"老鼠粄。","img":"images/628894/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉剁成末，用盐、胡椒粉、淀粉、油，拌匀入味。","img":"images/628894/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再准备适量的蒜末、葱末、葱花。","img":"images/628894/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中水煮开，倒入老鼠粄。","img":"images/628894/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮至浮起捞出装盘备用。","img":"images/628894/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"接下来开始做拌粉的酱料，热锅放入猪油。","img":"images/628894/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入葱、蒜末。","img":"images/628894/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒至酥香。","img":"images/628894/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入肉末。","img":"images/628894/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒至变色。","img":"images/628894/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量的清水滚开。","img":"images/628894/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入酱油、鱼露、沙茶酱、胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/628894/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后撒入香油、鸡精和葱花，关火。把做好的肉酱料浇入老鼠粄表面即可。","img":"images/628894/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。有客家人的地方就有老鼠粄。","img":"images/628894/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。嫩滑Q弹，咸香味美。","img":"images/628894/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}